!Sample_data_processing = Normalization: FPKM normalization was applied using edgeR after intra- and inter-sample normalization (“calcNormFactors” and “estimateTagwiseDisp”).
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: hg19 for human; mm10 for mouse
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: tsv-table of FPKM values
