!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell type: mouse leukemic cells from spleen
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: 0.8g/kg valine diet
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Human cell line KOPTK1 was either treated with DMSO control or gamma-secretase inhibitor (Compound E, Alexis Bioscience, ALX-270-415-C250) for 72h. For the in vivo experiments, mice secondrary transplanted with NOTCH-delta E tumors were fed either valine proficient control diet or valine deficient diet or valine defiecinet diet substituted with either 0.8g/L or 0.4g/L valine in drinking water. Mice were sacrificed after 3 weeks in different diets and leuekmic cells were sorted from spleen using GFP as a marker and used for RNA isolation.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA was extracted using the RNeasy Mini Kit using Qiagen kit (Catalog no: 74106) folllowing manufacturer's guidelines.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = The libraries were prepared using NEXTflex Rapid Directional RNA-Seq Kit from Bioo Scientific (Catalog no: 5138-07) folllowing manufacturer's guidelines.
!Sample_description = primary_mouse_FPKM.tsv
